# helper (persona)

This skill is a pointer to the `helper` specialist.

- To delegate work to it, use the Agent tool with `subagent_type: "helper"`.
- Its full instructions are in `.claude/agents/helper.md`. If you cannot delegate, read
  that file and apply it inline.
- Subagents never ask the user directly; they return open questions to the caller.

